OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FEarly
OL,6,Frain Thursday across the east,
OL,7,Fclearing erratically as brighter
OL,8,Fspells and showers feed from west.
OL,9,FScattered showers for Friday, focused
OL,10,Fin west. Saturday mainly dry,
OL,11,Foccasionally bright.
